SUMMARY: 🎨 Art Bus Tour to McMichael Canadian Art Gallery & Textile Mus
 eum of Canada ++
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎨 **
 McMICHAEL CANADIAN ART GALLERY & TEXTILE MUSEUM OF CANADA + DINNER** 🎨\
 n\n**Discover two of Canada’s leading cultural institutions in one day w
 ith this special bus excursion from the Textile Museum of Canada to the Mc
 Michael Canadian Art Collection.** Explore six exhibitions spanning contem
 porary fashion\, textiles\, Indigenous art\, and iconic Canadian landscape
 s\, while enjoying comfortable round-trip transportation between venues\, 
 and admission to both Art Gallery and Museum. There will also be an opport
 unity to purchase a hearty lunch from Food Dudes\, and join for dinner aft
 er returning. It’s an all-Canadian outing that is not to be missed! **No
 te: this tour is sold out\, but I have secured a few tickets for members.*
 *\n\n**EXPECT**\n\\- full access to **six exhibitions**\n\\- Starting with
  the Textile Museum of Canada: *[Made By Many: 50 Years of the Textile Mus
 eum of Canada](https://textilemuseum.ca/event/made-by-many-50-years-of-the
 -textile-museum-of-canada/)*\, \\*[Taking Shape: Recent Acquisitions](http
 s://textilemuseum.ca/event/taking-shape-recent-acquisitions/)\\*\, and *[l
 ways in Fashion](https://textilemuseum.ca/event/always-in-fashion/)*\n\\- 
 Then\\\, on to the McMichael for three exhibitions: *[Old Growth: Masterwo
 rks by the Group of Seven and their Contemporaries](https://mcmichael.com/
 exhibition/old-growth-masterworks-by-the-group-of-seven-and-their-contempo
 raries/)\,* *[Fresh Air: New Acquisitions in Context](https://mcmichael.co
 m/exhibition/fresh-air-new-acquisitions-in-context/)*\, and *[Early Days: 
 Indigenous Art from the McMichael](https://mcmichael.com/exhibition/early-
 days-indigenous-art-at-the-mcmichael/)*\n\n**ITINERARY**\n*(Bus times are 
 approximate and subject to change due to traffic)*\n**11:50AM: Meet outsid
 e the Textile Museum of Canada at 55 Centre Ave.**\n**12:00PM:** Enter the
  Museum as a group as it opens\n**1:25PM:** Meet at the entrance to the Mu
 seum to board the bus as a group\n**1:30PM**: Bus departs from Textile Mus
 eum of Canada\n**2:30PM:** Arrive at McMichael Canadian Art Collection\n**
 3:50PM:** Meet outside the entrance to McMichael to board the bus as a gro
 up\n**4:00PM**: Bus departs from McMichael Canadian Art Collection\n**5:00
 PM:** Bus arrives at Textile Museum of Canada\n**5:00PM:** Head out for di
 nner at a nearby restaurant\n\n**COST:**\nBus Art Tour (includes round-tri
 p bus transportation from Textile Museum\, plus admissions to both McMicha
 el Gallery and Textile Museum) + Taxes + Meetup fee = $30\n\n**SIGNING-UP*
 *\n\n* **RSVP Yes/No to dinner after\, and include your cell and email (re
 quired for all out-of-town events\, only visible to me).** Everyone goes o
 n the waitlist until they have paid for their ticket. I will then reach ou
 t to you with the email to transfer the $30 to secure your spot. Once you 
 pay for your ticket\, you will be moved to attending. There are no refunds
 .\n* Your ticket will be provided at the meetup time and location.\n* A re
 minder will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where
  to meet and when.\n* RSVPs close 2 days prior and cancellations may resul
 t in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n***\n\n**MEETUP TIME (see 
 event itinerary)**\n**Meet me at: 11:50AM outside the Textile Museum of Ca
 nada at 55 Centre Ave.**\n**12PM**: Bus Tour starts\nBus Tour length: 5 ho
 urs\nAfter: We will head out to a nearby restaurant\n\nEnjoy and please po
 st your Comments in the event after8
