DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n**Plot*
 * **summary**: A meteorologist and cybersecurity expert find themselves at
  the centre of a movement to expose the government's coverup of extraterre
 strial secrets.\n\nTrailer\\*\\*: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbd
 PdU\n\n**Time the Meetup group will meet at:** **6:25pm**...Please **check
  in** **with** **me** ***by 6:30pm***\, **as we will go into the theatre a
 t that time.**\n\n**Time the movie STARTS:** ***6:40pm***\n\n**Movie Runni
 ng Time:** *2hr 40min*\n\n**Meetup Spot:** Bottom of the indoor steps to I
 ndigo - Directly across from Cineplex.\n\n**How to Find the Theatre:** Sec
 ond floor of the Yonge Eglinton Centre - next to Yonge St.\n\n**Where I wi
 ll be sitting:** I will be in ROW "G" SEAT "G10'\n\n**Click here to go to 
 the website to buy your ticket:** [https://www.cineplex.com/](https://www.
 cineplex.com/)\n\n**After the Movie:** We will reconvene by the steps lead
 ing to INDIGO\, and talk about the meaningful scenes in the movie. Then\, 
 for those who answered YES to the question\, we will go into the Pickle Ba
 rrel for a drink or a bite.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** Ticket must be bought befo
 re signing up. You will be asked where you will be sitting. Seating is ver
 y limited.\n*Don't forget to join Cineplex's new MOIVE CLUB for those that
  love movies and discounts* - [https://www.cineplex.com/cineclub](https://
 www.cineplex.com/cineclub)\n\n**NOTE:** All movies are subject to change\,
  I will always try for the best time\, and to see a movie in 2D (some movi
 es are a must in 3D) for the best price. \\*\\*\\*Also\, please keep an ey
 e out for any changes in venue or movie times.\n**I look forward to seeing
  you there!!**\n\n**THIS GROUP IS OPEN TO THOSE WHO WANT TO BE SOCIAL\, MA
 KE FRIENDS\, WHO ARE SINGLE OR NOT SINGLE. WE ALSO HAVE LOTS OF OTHER EVEN
 TS LIKE\, MOVIES\, WALKS\, HIKES\, ARTS & CULTURE AND RESTAURANTS. WE LOVE
  TO SUPPORT MEMEBERS TO SOCIALIZE AND TO FORM LONG LASTING FRIENDSHIPS.**\
 n\n**Toronto Movies and Social Group: Policy**\n\nPlease do not use your c
 ellphone\, talk\, or otherwise disrupt the enjoyment of others around you\
 , once the movie starts. Any complaints will be dealt with first as a warn
 ing\, then subsequent removal from the group on repeated complaints.\n\n**
 Rules:** [Click Here!](https://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-gr
 oup/events/293241263/)\n**Getting The Best Out Of Meet:** [Click Here!](ht
 tps://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-group/events/293241269/)\n\
 nDon't Forget to join our email list (Meetup does not send out emails to\n
 everyone in a group) to get our weekly news later about upcoming events: [
 http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](http://eepurl.com/hKt76f)\n\nFacebook group @ [h
 ttp://www.facebook.com/groups/502945113062739/](http://www.facebook.com/gr
 oups/502945113062739/)\n\n**Scene card:** A Scene card helps you to collec
 t movie points at Cineplex movie theatres. After 1000 points or 10 movies 
 your 11th movie is free. If you love to see movies then this is a must hav
 e card. Go to - [https://www.scene.ca](https://www.scene.ca/) to get your 
 card today\n\nMathew is the organizer for this meetup. If you need to cont
 act him\, please post a message on the wall\, or email him torontomoviesan
 doutings@[hotmail.com](http://hotmail.com/)
