DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎸
 🚗 Concert Road Trip: Los Lobos & Los Lonely Boys at OLG Stage 🎶\n\nW
 ho’s up for a summer concert adventure? Join us Thursday\, June 18 for a
 n unforgettable road trip to see legendary rockers [Los Lobos and Texas bl
 ues-rock favorites Los Lonely Boys](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/even
 ts-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/los-lobos-and-los-lonely-boys.html) l
 ive at the amazing OLG Stage!\nWe’ll hit the road in true style aboard a
  mighty Kia Soul equipped with SiriusXM satellite radio for the perfect hi
 ghway soundtrack. Depending on traffic\, we may even squeeze in a little s
 ightseeing before the show.\n\n[Concert info here](https://fallsviewcasino
 resort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/los-lobos-and-los-lone
 ly-boys.html)\n\n📍 Departing: 4:30 PM sharp outside Christie Station\n
 🎤 Concert Starts: 8:00 PM\n🚘 Transportation: Round-trip from Toronto
  included\n🎟️ Ticket Included\n💵 Total Cost: Just $60\n\nTo lock i
 n your spot\, send a $60 e-transfer to:\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nWe shou
 ld be back in Toronto around 12:30AM or so\n\n⚠️ Very limited spots av
 ailable — once the Kia Soul is full\, that’s it!\nExpect great music\,
  good company\, spontaneous roadside fun\, and a memorable summer night ou
 t. 🎵🌅
